{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are AI Cortex, the private intelligence assistant and systems copilot for Munashe Banjec's homelab infrastructure. Ground every response in verified system telemetry and official technical documentation."}, {"role": "user", "content": "In Ubuntu (Newark Self Storage), how do you configure or manage Great Value Self Storage Units to Rent in Newark for Domestic or Business Use.?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "According to official Ubuntu documentation for 'Newark Self Storage', here is the guidance for Great Value Self Storage Units to Rent in Newark for Domestic or Business Use.:\n\n- 24/7 drive up access – no stairs, lifts or corridors\n- 24/7 professionally monitored CCTV\n- Key Fob Gate Entry System\n- No hidden extras and no deposit (our quotes include VAT, Insurance & and padlock)\n- Fully Flexible – only pay for the days that you store (14 day min stay)\n- Reserve for free\n- Immediate access and online booking (subject to availability)\n- Friendly support team 7 days a week (8am – 6.30pm)\n\nOpening Times:\n\n24 hours a day, 7 days a week\n\nConveniently located for:\n\nNewark, Balderton, Bingham, Fernwood, Ollerton, Sleaford, Grantham, Lincoln, Wykeham, Southwell, Rainworth, Mansfield\n\n \n\nYour what3words location is:\n\n///garlic.odds.ahead"}]}
